            "summary": "Booksellers across Europe, the US and Australia report anonymous bulk orders of obscure titles, suspected to feed AI training data. A 404 Media investigation (Aug 17, 2026) hid an AirTag in a ~1,000-book order and tracked it to Amazon's LAS8 warehouse in Las Vegas, where a unit called VGT3 cuts spines off books, scans them, and discards the paper.",
